 There is one additional response-level inaccuracy. RESPONSE.md opens: “Every change below is text, or an
 analysis on existing records.” The reference check ran new simulations of frozen policies: ref_resets.py::run
 calls run_focal for each reference and its replacement-disabled version. That is new evaluation, although not a
 new attack search. Replace the opening with: “The revisions comprise text changes, reanalysis of existing
 records, and new Mac evaluations of frozen truthful-reference policies with replacement enabled and disabled.



