 6. Open runs, ranked by potential score change

 1. Honest-churn arm
 This has the greatest potential to change my WEIS score. The exact limitation is: “The honest opponents never
 replace their identities...” (p. 27). Contrary to the previous referee’s characterization, not every newcomer is
